        "Operator Precedence and Associativity\n",
        "\n",
        "***Operator Precedence:***\n",
        "* It dictates the order in which operations are performed in an expression.\n",
        "* Operators with higher precedence are evaluated before operators with lower precedence, like multiplication before addition.\n",
        "* Parentheses can be used to override the default evaluation order.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
